  "details": "Animated Camera Mod: Recorded path, angle, speed, etc... of moving camera for seamless, cinematic recordings.  \nFreeze Frame Mod that allowed players to record their FBT movement and drop that recording anywhere using any avatar up to any number (local only) were great for filming projects. \nPlayer Rotator mod: helped for actors that needed to defy physics/local space. Also good for letting players be upright while laying down IRL.\n\nIf not already on the to do list, those lost tools would be great to have by default in VRchat.",
